      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facilitated dislocation motion causes lower yield strength and hardness.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facilitated dislocation motion produces excellent plasticity and machinability.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing CoCrFeNiTi at 600–700 °C can promote short-range chemical order.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermally induced short-range chemical order takes the form of nanoscale clusters.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Short-range order or nanoscale clusters act as dislocation-pinning sites.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing-induced ordering will increase the yield strength of CoCrFeNiTi relative to the rapidly quenched alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing-induced ordering will increase the hardness of CoCrFeNiTi relative to the rapidly quenched alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing-induced ordering will reduce the ductility of CoCrFeNiTi relative to the rapidly quenched alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The degree of short-range order or clustering controls the balance among deformation behavior, hardness, and strength.",
